      "id": "HOB-01",
      "title": "A bounded common frame for an ordered face",
      "statement": "For a totally complex number field F and N≥1, every ordered (p+1)-tuple in the specified Hermitian face complex has N common minimal integral vectors linearly independent over F. Their matrix A has 1≤|Norm det A|≤J=D^N d^d, where D=|disc F| and d=[F:Q]N.",
