    {
      "id": "HOB-02",
      "title": "Residue counting for a bounded determinant norm",
      "statement": "For any number field F and an integral N-by-N frame A with r=|Norm det A|>0, B=rA⁻¹ is integral. Equal residues of B mod r for frames of the same r imply left GL_N(O_F)-equivalence. At most r^{dN} representatives suffice at norm r, and J^{1+dN} suffice for 1≤r≤J.",
